  "ruleText": "Gal 502.01 “Appointing court” means a court which appoints a guardian ad litem to serve in a particular case.\n\nSource. #8941, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15\n\nNew. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16\n\nNew. #12010, eff 10-21-16",
